Lumtub contains settings and player UI adapted from PiliNara.

PiliNara: https://github.com/Starfallan/PiliNara
Copyright (C) PiliNara contributors.
Licensed under GNU General Public License version 3 or later.

The adapted sources are lib/widgets/pilinara_settings_tiles.dart (setting
rows, choice, slider and list dialogs, colour palette and colour picker),
lib/ui/pages/settings_page.dart (the grouped settings layout with search),
lib/ui/pages/settings_subpages.dart (speed, theme colour, font, log and
about pages), lib/ui/player_controls.dart (the control layer over the
video: title and bottom bars, menus and the "more" sheet) and
lib/widgets/video_progress_bar.dart (the desktop progress bar). Playback
itself is Lumtub's own media_kit/libmpv code.

